<title>INDIA: India Cements 1996/97 6-mth net up 2 pct.</title>
<headline>India Cements 1996/97 6-mth net up 2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p>	     (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  443.7  vs    435.6</p>
<p>    Sales &amp; other income  4,165.7  vs  3,805.5</p>
<p>    Expenditure	     3,281.3  vs  3,050.6</p>
<p>    Operating profit	  884.4  vs    754.9</p>
<p>    Interest costs	    228.2  vs    162.9</p>
<p>    Gross profit		656.2  vs    592.0</p>
<p>    Depreciation		212.5  vs    156.4</p>
<p>    Tax			   Nil    vs    Nil</p>
<p>Note: India Cements Ltd, a leading cement maker of South India, said provision for income tax would be determined and provided at the end of the financial year.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom (91-22-265 9000)</p>
</text>
